::  vouch-real: a sponsor's declaration that one of its moons is a real
::  (booted) ship, so recipients stop proxying through the host and talk to
::  it directly. accepted only when .src sponsors the moon -- see /app/vouch.
::
|_  =ship
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  ship
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  ,@p
  --
--
